"www.dhnews.co.kr", "url": "https://www.dhnews.co.kr/news/cate/181929144?pagenum=81"}]}, "검색 결과로 보면, 이황은 성균관대사성에 두 차례 제수되었습니다. 첫 번째는 53세(1553년으로 환산) 4월이었는데 성균관대사성에 제수되었으나 사퇴한다고 기록되어 있어 실제로 취임하지 않은 것으로 보입니다. 두 번째는 58세(1558년으로 환산) 때로, 이 자리에 임명되자 사직을 청했지만 받아들여지지 않았고 공조참판에 임명되었다고 나옵니다.\n\n다만 출처에는 서기 연도가 명시되어 있지 않고 나이만 적혀 있습니다. 이황은 1501년생이므로 한국식 나이로 53세는 1553년, 58세는 1558년에 해당합니다. 이 연도 환산은 제가 계산한 것이며, 정확한 연도는 『퇴계집』이나 『조선왕조실록』 등 원자료로 확인하시는 것이 좋겠습니다. 검색된 다른 자료들에는 이 임명 기록이 나오지 않았습니다."], "durationSeconds": 6.410197290999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_017JJEfbLSpf4LwgSZbfQ62p", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01HYHdUQ5EcS2vtD36Xo8jHH", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.rujiazg.com/article/27379\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Yi_Hwang\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/T%27oegye\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.davidkennardphotography.com/photos/482-Yi-Hwang-Statue.xhtml\"}, {\"url\": \"https://api.philpapers.org/rec/KANYTR\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ridibooks.com/author/88780\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.nownews.com/news/6016034\"}, {\"url\": \"https://revistas.unileon.es/index.php/sinologia/article/download/5254/4058/18980\"}, {\"url\": \"https://m.cafe.daum.net/gobangseyee/LYDs/1370\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:14:29.795Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "退溪 李滉 成均館大司成 제수 명종 년 사직", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_0177kCAdKznhJt1JnRoxG4JP", "content": [{"title": "www.rujiazg.com", "url": "https://www.rujiazg.com/article/27379"}, {"title": "Yi Hwang", "url": "https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Yi_Hwang"}, {"title": "www.newworldencyclopedia.org", "url": "https://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/T%27oegye"}, {"title": "Yi Hwang Statue", "url": "https://www.davidkennardphotography.com/photos/482-Yi-Hwang-Statue.xhtml"}, {"title": "Yi T’oegye’s Reverent Seriousness and Philosophical Therapy", "url": "https://api.philpapers.org/rec/KANYTR"}, {"title": "ridibooks.com", "url": "https://ridibooks.com/author/88780"}, {"title": "www.nownews.com", "url": "https://www.nownews.com/news/6016034"}, {"title": "revistas.unileon.es", "url": "https://revistas.unileon.es/index.php/sinologia/article/download/5254/4058/18980"}, {"title": "m.cafe.daum.net", "url": "https://m.cafe.daum.net/gobangseyee/LYDs/1370"}]}, "The search didn't turn up a source that gives the specific appointment as 成均館大司成 under King Myeongjong, nor the date or circumstances of his resignation from it. What it did show is more general:\n\n- A Chinese-language source lists 成均館大司成 among the posts Yi Hwang (Toegye) held, alongside 丹阳郡守, 丰基郡守, 大提学, and 知经筵. 曾任丹阳郡守、丰基郡守、成均馆大司成、大提学、知经筵等官职\n- The Korean ridibooks biography shows a pattern of repeated appointments and resignations. For example, at 69 he was named 이조판서 (Minister of Personnel) and 표명하고 귀향했다, meaning he declined and went home. That is a later post than the one you asked about, so it doesn't answer your question directly.\n- A Chinese-language biography says that 1534年，才又重新回到成均館任職, which places a return to the Sungkyunkwan around 1534. That is under Jungjong, not Myeongjong, so it's a different period.\n- The same source says that 到了明宗時期，經過明宗多次邀請，他在67歲時重返朝政, meaning he returned to government under Myeongjong's repeated invitations at age 67. That corresponds to about 1567, and it's the closest the results come to your Myeongjong period.\n\nTo pin down the specific appointment and resignation, I'd suggest checking the Korean-language sources, such as the 한국고전종합DB (Korean Classics DB) entries for 이황 or the Sillok (실록) records for Myeongjong's reign, which should list the appointment date and any 사직 (resignation) requests."], "durationSeconds": 6.926796, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01HYHdUQ5EcS2vtD36Xo8jHH", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
